      "content": "those counselors just talk about restructuring debt or more consolidation. it doesnt change the fact that there's no way out that actually feels like a win. it's like being in a sinkhole. you can try to climb, but you're just getting more tired and the hole is just getting deeper. i'm just so tired of fighting a system that's designed to keep me under. it feels like the only way to actually stop the math from hurting is to just... stop the whole equation entirely. does that even make sense?",
